382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (Good morning. It is my great pleasure to welcome you all to the 2026 Annual General Meeting of the Zambian Music Copyright Protection Society.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (Allow me to sincerely thank our members, especially those who have travelled from different parts of the country, for making time to attend this important gathering. Your presence demonstrates your continued interest in the affairs of our Society.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (An Annual General Meeting is more than a constitutional requirement. It is an opportunity to reflect on our performance, account for our decisions and contribute to the future of our institution.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (ZAMCOPS belongs to its members. Its strength depends on the work of the Board and Secretariat, as well as the active participation of the people it represents.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
