/P 293 0 R
/E (The unauthorised use of protected musical works remains a concern. ZAMCOPS publicly cautioned artists about using existing musical compositions, including protected melodies and other elements, without proper permission.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 293 0 R
/E (Technology has made music production and distribution easier, but it has also increased the need to understand ownership and clearance requirements. The availability of a work online does not mean it can be reproduced or exploited commercially without authorisation.)
