560 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (Current status: PACRA opened public comments on the Copyright and Related Rights Bill in January 2026, with an original deadline of 31 January 2026. The deadline was extended to 31 March 2026. Submissions were made by EIFL, IFLA and the Geneva Centre on Knowledge Governance \(joint\), and by IFRRO and CISAC.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
561 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (All these efforts and initiatives require our collective minds, connections and influence to bring them to fruition.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
562 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (This election period in our country presents enormous opportunities for us to engage the lawmakers, even the Head of State, and demand that they attend to our plight. Instead of handouts, this time around, we demand a new Copyright Act that adequately addresses these challenges.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
563 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (We also demand the inclusion of, or a statutory instrument for, the commencement of the blank media/private copying levy, which has the potential to economically boost the creative sector and the economy at large.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
564 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (The Push for a New Copyright Act)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
