/P 297 0 R
/E (Conclusion)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
567 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (I would like to end by encouraging each artist and member of ZAMCOPS: while we are not yet experiencing the full benefits of our membership with the Society, please do not relent. Our creative sector holds immense potential to drive the growth of our institution, so that it is adequately equipped to collect from every place that uses our copyrighted works and compensate fairly for that use. Each one of us can contribute to the ongoing initiatives, and our collective input will eventually bear our desired results. I warmly thank you.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
